ion-1814-1905","supplement":"dynastic-relations-2026-10-31"},{"id":"dynastic-relations-2026-10-31|Kingdom of Norway|Kingdom of Sweden|Q52927|1818","kind":"personalUnion","from":1818,"to":1844,"members":["Kingdom of Norway","Kingdom of Sweden"],"title":"共主关系 · 卡尔十四世·约翰","detail":"同一君主在两个王位的任期交集；两国的疆域、法律与行政制度并不因此合并。各王位任期的出处见统治者档案；摄政、分支统治与年内交接另列。","source":"https://www.kongehuset.no/historie/grunnlov-og-union-1814-1905","supplement":"dynastic-relations-2026-10-31"},{"id":"dynastic-relations-2026-10-31|Kingdom of Norway|Kingdom of Sweden|Q52928|1814","kind":"personalUnion","from":1814,"to":1818,"members":["Kingdom of Norway","Kingdom of Sweden"],"title":"共主关系 · 卡尔十三世","detail":"同一君主在两个王位的任期交集；两国的疆域、法律与行政制度并不因此合并。各王位任期的出处见统治者档案；摄政、分支统治与年内交接另列。","source":"https://www.kongehuset.no/historie/grunnlov-og-union-1814-1905","supplement":"dynastic-relations-2026-10-31"},{"id":"dynastic-relations-2026-10-31|kalmar-charter","kind":"politicalUnion","from":1397,"to":1523,"members":["Kingdom of Denmark","Kingdom of Norway","Kingdom of Sweden"],"title":"卡尔马联合的宪章与王朝框架","detail":"1397年联合宪章所联系的三个王国保有自身制度。瑞典在1448年后多次另立国王或摄政；这一框架记录不表示三国在整个时期持续共主、共同参战或服从统一中央政府。实际共主任期单独列出。","source":"https://www.norgeshistorie.no/kilder/senmiddelalder/K1011-Unionsbrev.html","supplement":"dynastic-relations-2026-10-31"},{"id":"dynastic-relations-2026-10-31|marriage|马克西米利安 × 勃艮第的玛丽","kind":"royalMarriage","from":1477,"to":1482,"members":["Austrian Hereditary Lands","Burgundian Netherlands"],"title":"马克西米利安 × 勃艮第的玛丽","detail":"王室婚姻连接两套世袭领地；玛丽去世后由腓力继承尼德兰，马克西米利安的摄政不能写成奥地利吞并全部尼德兰。","source":"https://www.habsburger.net/en/chapter/reuniting-habsburg-lands-maximilian-i","supplement":"dynastic-relations-2026-10-31"},{"id":"dynastic-relations-2026-10-31|marriage|斐迪南 × 安娜·雅盖洛","kind":"royalMarriage","from":1521,"to":1547,"members":["Austrian Hereditary Lands","Kingdom of Bohemia","Kingdom of Hungary"],"title":"斐迪南 × 安娜·雅盖洛","detail":"1521年成婚。1526年路易二世死亡后发生王位继承与选举；婚姻本身不等于此前已合并三国。","source":"https://jagiellonians.site.ox.ac.uk/jagiellonians-timeline","supplement":"dynastic-relations-2026-10-31"},{"id":"dynastic-relations-2026-10-31|marriage|路易二世 × 奥地利的玛丽","kind":"royalMarriage","from":1522,"to":1526,"members":["Kingdom of Bohemia","Kingdom of Hungary","Austrian Hereditary Lands"],"title":"路易二世 × 奥地利的玛丽","detail":"1522年举行婚礼，至1526年路易二世战死；不把1515年的订婚安排误写成已经成婚。","source":"https://jagiellonians.site.ox.ac.uk/jagiellonians-timeline","supplement":"dynastic-relations-2026-10-31"}],"principle":"Intersect the same person in separate crowns; keep charter claims separate from effective personal union."}